WEBVTT

00:01.440 --> 00:02.440
Then this is poison?

00:02.770 --> 00:04.030
I'll use an antidote spell.

00:06.250 --> 00:07.790
My antidote spell isn't working.

00:08.630 --> 00:12.610
It seems he's been given a powerful poison.

00:13.920 --> 00:18.380
So they poisoned their own comrade? Cowards!

00:22.290 --> 00:23.670
Jace...

00:23.670 --> 00:26.710
You know they've given up on you, right?

00:28.930 --> 00:32.130
There's no need to keep silent 
for their sake, is there?

00:32.730 --> 00:37.090
Tell me their name. I'll get revenge for you.

00:38.330 --> 00:40.060
Their name is...

00:58.950 --> 01:01.890
It seems like things are getting serious.

01:03.110 --> 01:07.120
Cefiro, you know why you're here, right?

01:07.330 --> 01:07.970
Yes.

01:08.600 --> 01:14.090
The one behind this was the head 
of the Third Corps, Basteo.

01:14.580 --> 01:17.450
Do you have proof?

01:18.160 --> 01:22.060
He brought my vice-commander to his side, 
and was planning to kill the two of us,

01:22.060 --> 01:25.680
and you as well.

01:25.680 --> 01:27.350
I see.

01:27.830 --> 01:30.660
That's what Cefiro says.

01:30.660 --> 01:32.690
But what do you have to say?

03:15.460 --> 03:19.970
<i>Duel</i>

03:26.920 --> 03:31.600
Basteo, it seems she has a different 
opinion on the matter than you do.

03:31.860 --> 03:35.260
As I said just a moment ago...

03:35.260 --> 03:42.070
These two have slain their own 
vice-commander in an attempt to frame me.

03:42.420 --> 03:44.890
They're plotting against me.

03:45.860 --> 03:47.240
What?

03:47.530 --> 03:53.210
I assume they're plotting to 
steal the Third Corps from me.

03:53.560 --> 03:56.430
It's the kind of plot 
I'd expect from a mere witch.

03:56.430 --> 03:57.690
You bastard...

03:59.510 --> 04:00.730
Calm yourself.

04:01.700 --> 04:02.330
Of course.

04:02.960 --> 04:07.780
The more power a demon has, 
the more power they seek.

04:08.380 --> 04:11.700
Wealth, glory, influence...

04:11.700 --> 04:15.890
Yes, ambition is what makes us who we are.

04:15.890 --> 04:19.290
If I were to kill my men over their 
ambition, I'd soon have none left.

04:20.150 --> 04:25.000
Basteo, did you honestly think 
I wouldn't see through your plot?

04:25.890 --> 04:29.940
Cefiro, your loyalty is true,

04:30.180 --> 04:33.690
but you are responsible for failing 
to maintain your men's loyalty.

04:33.690 --> 04:35.710
I am aware.

04:39.310 --> 04:44.430
Our code of laws says that
I should punish you both.

04:49.630 --> 04:53.540
But I don't wish to lose 
two corps commanders

04:53.540 --> 04:56.960
in the middle of our war with the humans.

04:57.660 --> 05:00.820
However, I cannot simply ignore this matter.

05:01.610 --> 05:02.760
And so...

05:02.760 --> 05:03.870
There will be a duel.

05:04.700 --> 05:07.010
Whoever wins, I believe.

05:07.010 --> 05:10.030
That's how demons should handle things.

05:16.750 --> 05:21.960
The Demon Lord just sent 
me the details of the duel.

05:22.350 --> 05:23.270
I see.

05:24.290 --> 05:30.350
The duel will be held using
 magical creatures known as "puppets."

05:30.960 --> 05:33.780
The commander will be the 
representative of their team,

05:33.780 --> 05:36.080
and cannot participate 
in the battle themselves.

05:36.080 --> 05:38.300
They will command 50 puppets,

05:38.300 --> 05:42.330
and will win if they can wipe out 
all of the enemy's puppets.

05:42.330 --> 05:44.780
The loser will die on the spot.

05:45.600 --> 05:50.190
That's how the Demon Lord has 
decided to hold the duel.

05:51.790 --> 05:54.070
Why something so complicated?

05:54.620 --> 05:56.710
Couldn't she just have you fight?

05:57.080 --> 06:00.470
She wants to test our skills as commanders.

06:02.080 --> 06:03.920
She is certainly unusual.

06:04.470 --> 06:05.800
This will be difficult.

06:05.800 --> 06:10.390
Oh, we're allowed to appoint 
stand-ins for the duel.

06:11.940 --> 06:14.350
Ike, you go for me.

06:14.350 --> 06:17.010
Oh, all right.

06:18.040 --> 06:18.560
Then...

06:18.560 --> 06:19.580
Huh?!

06:27.950 --> 06:31.160
So this is where the duel will be held?

06:32.760 --> 06:34.120
Ike-sama?

06:38.740 --> 06:41.120
Your life's on the line!

06:41.600 --> 06:44.320
Shouldn't you go yourself?

06:44.320 --> 06:47.840
I picked the way that's 
most likely to get me a win.

06:47.840 --> 06:49.560
You understand, right?

06:49.560 --> 06:54.690
Your talents as a commander 
already exceed mine.

06:58.400 --> 06:59.780
That's not true.

06:59.780 --> 07:01.930
Don't get the wrong idea.

07:01.930 --> 07:04.930
I'm only talking about your 
skills as a commander.

07:04.930 --> 07:08.030
I'm still the better corps leader.

07:14.280 --> 07:17.610
I'm entrusting you with my life.

07:19.900 --> 07:23.050
<i>I wish she hadn't entrusted 
</i>me<i> with her life.</i>

07:23.680 --> 07:25.280
<i>It's too big a burden.</i>

07:26.450 --> 07:29.500
Ike-sama, is something wrong?

07:29.500 --> 07:32.190
No, I was just thinking about how

07:32.190 --> 07:35.760
the Corps Commander is every bit
as unusual as the Demon Lord.

07:37.760 --> 07:41.630
You're pretty unusual yourself!

07:41.630 --> 07:44.730
Like how you tell us not 
to kill for no reason!

07:45.220 --> 07:47.300
<i>He thinks I'm like them, huh?</i>

07:48.960 --> 07:51.700
<i>For now, I should think of a way to win.</i>

07:58.280 --> 08:00.330
So these are puppets.

08:00.730 --> 08:03.000
Their faces are kind of eerie.

08:03.000 --> 08:05.730
How do you make them fight?

08:05.730 --> 08:09.290
They follow their commander's 
orders to the letter, I'm told.

08:10.240 --> 08:12.350
All of them are exactly equal in strength.

08:12.920 --> 08:15.790
So the only test is of 
your command abilities.

08:16.760 --> 08:18.620
And those weapons?

08:18.620 --> 08:20.720
We're free to use them as we like.

08:20.960 --> 08:23.200
That's wonderful.

08:23.200 --> 08:26.190
The Demon Lord's so generous!

08:42.130 --> 08:43.120
Here you go.

08:45.260 --> 08:49.530
Satie, what do you think is 
the best way to win a battle?

08:49.530 --> 08:51.920
Um, I don't know.

08:52.370 --> 08:55.060
Okay, let's say you're 
going to get into a fight.

08:55.520 --> 08:56.550
How will you fight?

08:56.800 --> 08:59.390
I don't want to fight.

08:59.870 --> 09:04.310
I'd rather solve things over a cup of tea.

09:04.680 --> 09:06.780
I agree completely.

09:06.780 --> 09:13.280
But there many people in this world who aren't 
satisfied unless they get to fight someone.

09:14.000 --> 09:15.550
Just hypothetically.

09:15.550 --> 09:17.410
How would you fight, Satie?

09:17.410 --> 09:19.740
If I had to...

09:22.410 --> 09:24.750
I'd use a broom!

09:25.510 --> 09:30.000
But I don't think I could really hit someone.

09:30.000 --> 09:31.150
That's correct.

09:32.590 --> 09:33.580
A broom.

09:34.250 --> 09:38.590
A weapon would allow you to attack 
without getting close to the enemy.

09:39.030 --> 09:40.810
A sword's a better choice than a dagger.

09:40.810 --> 09:42.500
And a spear's a better choice than a sword.

09:42.500 --> 09:44.060
And a bow is even better.

09:44.440 --> 09:49.520
The way to win is always to 
be able to strike from afar.

09:49.930 --> 09:53.980
Well, of course my opponent knows that.

09:54.250 --> 09:56.570
From afar?

09:56.570 --> 10:02.410
Oh, I remember my master in Arsenam 
saying that crossbows are amazing.

10:02.410 --> 10:03.740
Crossbows?

10:04.430 --> 10:05.570
That's not a bad idea.

10:06.120 --> 10:08.230
They can penetrate metal armor,

10:08.230 --> 10:10.140
and are easier to use than bows.

10:12.520 --> 10:13.770
But that's not enough.

10:15.390 --> 10:19.340
I need something more powerful than a 
crossbow, something they don't know about.

10:20.550 --> 10:22.080
I know just the thing!

10:23.360 --> 10:24.970
I can make guns!

10:25.560 --> 10:27.820
Guns?

10:27.820 --> 10:32.290
I've never heard of them. Are they strong?

10:32.290 --> 10:34.020
They're incredibly strong.

10:34.560 --> 10:37.570
They're more powerful and 
longer-ranged than crossbows.

10:37.570 --> 10:39.590
They allow you to attack from

10:39.590 --> 10:42.430
hundreds of meters away without 
your foe being able to fire back.

10:43.280 --> 10:45.210
That's amazing!

10:45.210 --> 10:48.080
But can you make something like that?

10:48.920 --> 10:54.540
The commander of the Seventh Corps 
is an incredibly powerful alchemist.

10:55.330 --> 10:58.670
She'll tell me there's nothing 
she can't do. I know it.

10:59.770 --> 11:02.390
There are some things I can't do.

11:05.720 --> 11:10.520
This thing you made is perfect 
for keeping the sun off.

11:10.520 --> 11:12.090
No, no, no.

11:12.090 --> 11:15.860
You always have this confident look on 
your face and say, "I can make anything!"

11:16.980 --> 11:19.260
I'm no god.

11:19.260 --> 11:22.290
How can I make something 
I've never even seen?

11:22.290 --> 11:27.970
It's an iron cylinder with gunpowder 
inside that explodes to propel a bullet.

11:27.970 --> 11:30.300
I know you can make it...

11:31.350 --> 11:34.960
Forget that. Why don't 
you join me in the water?

11:45.600 --> 11:50.140
The rumor is that they're sending Ike, 
the commander of the Undying Brigade.

11:50.140 --> 11:53.270
Perhaps she's scared of you, Basteo-sama.

11:53.530 --> 11:56.220
She's the commander of the Seventh Corps.

11:56.660 --> 11:58.820
She must have some plan.

12:00.000 --> 12:01.650
This is a wonderful sword.

12:02.110 --> 12:04.910
It's made from the fangs of a black dragon.

12:04.910 --> 12:07.010
It can cut anything.

12:07.010 --> 12:08.620
I like it.

12:09.660 --> 12:12.830
I'll have enough made for 
the puppets immediately!

12:13.090 --> 12:15.310
No, I need more.

12:15.310 --> 12:16.010
Huh?

12:18.480 --> 12:19.500
I've returned.

12:20.010 --> 12:21.010
How goes it?

12:21.770 --> 12:24.430
I believe you're sure to win.

12:25.840 --> 12:27.390
Of course I am.

12:35.470 --> 12:36.700
Sheesh.

12:37.860 --> 12:41.900
Does she realize that if I lose, she'll die?

12:47.250 --> 12:49.270
Oh, thanks.

12:51.680 --> 12:53.080
You're welcome.

12:58.930 --> 13:00.550
Th-The Demon Lord!

13:02.140 --> 13:04.000
<i>What's she doing here?</i>

13:04.000 --> 13:06.150
<i>When I'm dressed like this?</i>

13:07.000 --> 13:08.120
<i>No, wait.</i>

13:08.120 --> 13:09.550
<i>I don't have my mask on.</i>

13:09.550 --> 13:11.560
<i>So she shouldn't know who I am.</i>

13:14.370 --> 13:15.570
Open it.

13:15.570 --> 13:17.360
I'm sorry?

13:18.480 --> 13:19.740
Don't make me repeat myself!

13:19.740 --> 13:21.070
Right!

13:21.960 --> 13:24.030
Th-These are...

13:27.830 --> 13:30.300
These are what you were looking for, right?

13:31.050 --> 13:32.280
Ike.

13:41.160 --> 13:44.300
"I-Ike"?

13:45.850 --> 13:48.840
That's not my name.

13:49.130 --> 13:51.000
Don't bother trying to hide it.

13:51.710 --> 13:54.300
Romberg told me.

13:55.020 --> 13:59.560
He said he gave you all 
his knowledge and magic.

14:00.300 --> 14:03.020
So I was right.

14:03.360 --> 14:06.460
And that you were human, too.

14:08.150 --> 14:11.320
But if you knew I was human, then why...

14:13.510 --> 14:16.040
To make my wish come true.

14:17.760 --> 14:21.080
No matter how much power I possess,

14:21.080 --> 14:23.330
that's not enough on its own.

14:23.330 --> 14:26.300
I need people who will fight for me.

14:27.030 --> 14:29.720
Your "wish"?

14:31.760 --> 14:32.930
The world.

14:35.170 --> 14:38.520
I'll build the world 
I desire here in this land.

14:38.520 --> 14:44.940
And for that to happen, I need as 
many people as possible to serve me.

14:45.430 --> 14:50.630
Ike, I'm sure you will offer me much.

14:52.070 --> 14:53.870
And so, what is your answer?

14:55.560 --> 14:56.280
As you wish!

14:57.360 --> 14:58.650
I see.

15:06.540 --> 15:08.350
So these are guns, huh?

15:08.990 --> 15:11.670
The Demon Lord prepared them for me.

15:11.670 --> 15:13.800
There's a lot about her I don't understand.

15:14.120 --> 15:14.880
And so?

15:14.880 --> 15:17.770
I make these "bullets" out of lead?

15:21.440 --> 15:22.410
How about this?

15:22.410 --> 15:24.940
No, you should know that's too big.

15:25.840 --> 15:28.220
Something small enough to fit in here.

15:28.220 --> 15:30.650
Why didn't you say so?

15:30.650 --> 15:34.620
Detailed work makes my skin a mess.

15:35.050 --> 15:38.530
<i>You'll die if I lose, you know.</i>

15:43.250 --> 15:45.000
Wh-What happened?

15:46.220 --> 15:48.360
I didn't sense any magic.

15:48.360 --> 15:50.090
Was that your doing?

15:50.090 --> 15:50.970
Yes.

15:56.110 --> 15:59.890
Ike-sama, we've created what you asked for.

16:00.240 --> 16:02.800
Well done, Fiorentina.

16:03.860 --> 16:07.320
But what is it?

16:07.830 --> 16:12.570
Why would charcoal, sulfur, and 
saltpeter cause such an explosion?

16:12.570 --> 16:14.440
It's something called "gunpowder."

16:14.440 --> 16:15.700
Commander, the bullets.

16:15.700 --> 16:16.540
Here.

16:18.890 --> 16:20.000
Perfect.

16:20.530 --> 16:23.960
Commander, please get me another 500 or so.

16:24.220 --> 16:25.450
You heard him.

16:27.180 --> 16:29.880
Detail work is bad for my skin.

16:32.190 --> 16:35.040
Sorry. Please make me gunpowder and bullets.

16:35.040 --> 16:36.450
Of course.

16:36.990 --> 16:38.560
This is nothing new.

16:38.800 --> 16:41.520
I'll help, too.

16:41.840 --> 16:43.150
Please don't.

16:43.790 --> 16:44.800
Huh?

17:12.440 --> 17:13.720
What are those?

17:14.360 --> 17:17.010
Are you going to fight with just shields?

17:19.720 --> 17:21.710
Where's Cefiro?

17:21.710 --> 17:24.350
Off devising some plot?

17:25.280 --> 17:28.070
That's probably smart, honestly.

17:28.070 --> 17:30.900
It's clear how this is going to end up.

17:34.130 --> 17:35.280
That weaponry...

17:35.700 --> 17:37.120
You noticed, huh?

17:39.000 --> 17:40.530
Damascus steel?

17:40.530 --> 17:42.020
Correct.

17:43.220 --> 17:47.780
The strongest of metals, which can be 
penetrated by neither spear nor arrow.

17:47.780 --> 17:52.080
You won't be able to land 
a blow on my puppets.

17:53.200 --> 17:55.920
A gift from the Demon Lord.

17:58.560 --> 18:03.310
It seems the Demon Lord desires my victory.

18:06.540 --> 18:12.110
Ike, I'm sure you will offer me much.

18:12.820 --> 18:15.660
<i>Does she want an equal fight?</i>

18:15.660 --> 18:19.530
<i>Or is this some kind of test?</i>

18:20.590 --> 18:22.620
<i>I'll ask after I win.</i>

18:23.980 --> 18:27.710
The duel between the commander 
of the Third Corps, Basteo,

18:27.710 --> 18:31.320
and of the Seventh Corps, 
Cefiro, will now begin!

18:31.790 --> 18:35.570
Both sides will command 
an army of 50 puppets.

18:35.570 --> 18:39.230
The one who defeats all the enemy's 
puppets will be the winner.

18:39.740 --> 18:42.930
The loser will die here, today!

18:47.280 --> 18:50.810
Now, let the duel begin!

18:51.170 --> 18:52.270
Fire!

18:56.460 --> 18:57.400
Block.

19:01.310 --> 19:02.770
Charge.

19:11.700 --> 19:13.010
What's wrong?

19:13.010 --> 19:16.320
Don't you have any 
tactics besides defending?

19:20.800 --> 19:22.590
Attack back.

19:22.590 --> 19:24.910
You're boring me.

19:48.310 --> 19:49.250
Fire.

19:56.480 --> 19:58.050
What are those?

20:04.800 --> 20:05.850
Fire.

20:17.440 --> 20:18.610
Indeed.

20:33.920 --> 20:36.880
I-Impossible... Impossible!

20:37.820 --> 20:39.840
My puppets...

20:43.300 --> 20:46.120
The battle is over, Basteo.

20:46.990 --> 20:49.310
D-Demon Lord!

20:49.310 --> 20:52.330
I've prepared two choices for you.

20:53.320 --> 20:54.940
Kill yourself.

20:55.220 --> 20:57.400
Die an honorable death.

21:00.400 --> 21:02.520
Or I will kill you.

21:06.340 --> 21:07.740
Demon Lord...

21:08.180 --> 21:12.040
I'll choose something else.

21:12.950 --> 21:15.920
Yes. One befitting a demon.

21:19.860 --> 21:21.210
Demon Lord!

21:37.010 --> 21:38.310
Demon Lord...

21:45.070 --> 21:46.200
What?!

21:54.070 --> 21:56.880
From now on, I'm the Demon Lord!

23:34.140 --> 23:38.810
<i>Ambition</i>
